          '67th Scintilla National Science Festival 2024 · Project Display (Higher Secondary)',
          'The 1st National XSC Science Festival 2024 · Project Display (Higher Secondary)',
          '7th Laboratorians National Science Festival 2025 · Project Display (Higher Secondary)',
