      'Campus Ambassador — 1st AKSC National Science Festival 2024',
      'Campus Ambassador — Rajuk Sci-Spark 3.0',
      'Campus Ambassador — National Science & Innovation Carnival 2024',
      'Campus Ambassador — 15th DRMC National Science & Innovation Carnival',
